Package: querencia-rechner
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Querencia Desktop calculator (alpha)
 Querencia Rechner is the calculator of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2, modelled on gcalctool: basic and
 scientific mode, memory, keyboard input. Results are computed with full
 internal precision and rounded only for display.
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
